    <item>
      <title>AI编程进入“代码后稀缺时代”：Karpathy新指南揭秘，GPT-5 Pro成终极防线</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aikarpathygpt-5-pro-20250825124004850-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 25 Aug 2025 12:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
